From 58b888d5a2ba9aac0327e5f822422063b2a4ed9f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tobias Fischer <info@tobiasfischer.info>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 10:37:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] gui: Qt 6 compile fixes

- qt.h: QAction/QActionGroup/QShortcut moved to QtGui, drop QDesktopWidget
- enterEvent(QEvent*) -> enterEvent(QEnterEvent*) (silently stopped overriding)
- QStyleOption::init -> initFrom
- QFontMetrics::width -> horizontalAdvance
- QWheelEvent::pos -> position
- QSortFilterProxyModel::filterChanged -> invalidateFilter
- QFileDialog::DirectoryOnly -> Directory + ShowDirsOnly
- QString::null, QApplication::flush removed
- int -> Qt::Alignment, QPixmap -> QCursor explicit
